{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the speed of an arcade racer with the brawling of a fighting game, this cult classic made its mark with its originality and its own dose of chaos and personality.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race on tracks filled with obstacles and crazy settings (from Mount Rushmore to Transylvania), use special moves to knock out your rivals, and explore modes that go far beyond traditional racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to laugh, crash, accelerate, and fight for every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Racer Collection is pure arcade fun, straight from the past to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice</strong>: train before competing for real.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head-to-Head</strong>: race against a single opponent on a track of your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championship</strong>: create your own competitions by combining tracks and difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumble Mode</strong>: knock your opponents out of the arena!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soccer Mode</strong>: play soccer... with race cars! (not available in the MS-DOS version)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll find</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 games in 1</strong>: the collection includes the SNES, Megadrive, MS-DOS, and Game Boy versions of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 27 unique tracks</strong> full of shortcuts, traps, and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 cartoon characters</strong> with crazy vehicles and special attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied racing options</strong>: from a quick lap to 80-lap marathons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer</strong> for up to 4 players (on SNES, Megadrive, and MS-DOS versions)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play Street Racer Collection?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true cult classic, remembered to this day for its creativity and boldness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and pioneering mix of kart racing + combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guaranteed fun in both solo and local multiplayer modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A piece of video game history, preserved in its original form and experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to laugh, crash, accelerate, and fight for every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Racer Collection is pure arcade fun, straight from the past to your screen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gotta start somewhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/7dca60ebbe70b071caa7af0fd59c95b13a99c974.jpg"},{"name":"Going up the ranks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/47881967c66b41885f84d8daf8d8a4d9faaee0d8.jpg"},{"name":"Fuel burner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/6a3e791992515b131315766b8bc88baa1316773f.jpg"},{"name":"Low gear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/68512007be9a92bef1f01658ba75e0bb93cebb88.jpg"},{"name":"Medium gear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/5a6a171c5f6e1beaaab1f9361c7eff9458a4a475.jpg"},{"name":"On top of the world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3934850/8e46aa8e574dd599ec4a0841c1f92deb8b0e7b16.jpg